    "De la instalación al mueble: replanteamos la distribución, renovamos agua, luz y gas, y dejamos la cocina lista para montar o montada.": "From installation to the units: we rethink the layout, renew water, electricity and gas, and leave the kitchen ready to fit or already fitted.",
